# "Crew 1" needs creatures with total power 1 or more (CR 702.122a): on turn 3 the only other creature is an Ornithopter
# (0/2), whose power 0 is not enough, so `! Activate(Ability: Crew)` is refused. The positive control is a Basking
# Rootwalla (power 1) arriving at once and crewing it: the Locomotive attacks and makes one Treasure for it alone.

